7. Financial Support and Capitalization Plan

RTCM Platform LLC is currently self-funded by Mr. Santillo. The initial capitalization of $1,000 covers early operating costs. The platform's development is being advanced using available tools and resources during the pre-revenue phase, with the expectation that:

Pilot revenue (Q4 2026) will fund early infrastructure costs
Seed fundraising (Q2–Q3 2027) will be initiated following the first 5 paying customers, targeting $500,000–$1,000,000 to fund engineering hires, marketing, and SOC 2 certification
Series A (2028) will follow achievement of $1M ARR
The business is designed to reach first commercial revenue within 12 months of this document's publication without external capital, making the seed round an accelerant rather than a prerequisite.



